  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb — follows standard endings in every tense, no exceptions.",
    "Two common senses: literal/figurative \"to explode/snap\" (*algunas personas explotan*, \"some people snap/explode\") and \"to exploit\" (*explotar a los trabajadores*, \"to exploit the workers\").",
    "*Algunas de ellas explotan.* (\"Some of them explode/snap.\")",
    "*La fábrica explotaba a sus empleados.* (\"The factory used to exploit its employees.\")",
    "Related: *la explosión* (explosion, noun), *la explotación* (exploitation, noun), *estallar* (near-synonym, \"to burst/explode\")."
  ],
